description = "The demon's Strings lift a fallen ally like a puppet and set them on their feet. Brings back your fallen friendly target, or else the closest fallen ally within {range} m, where they fell, with {b:RAISE_HEALTH_PCT}% health and {b:RAISE_MANA_PCT}% mana. Only usable out of combat."
